pplements/5821993-Bacto-Tryptone/?ppim=5821993_0)\nciteturn14search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; # Bacto Tryptone from BD Biosciences ...   * Catalog Number 211699 / 211705 / 211701\n\n# Bacto Tryptone from BD Biosciences\n\n## Description\n\nBacto™ Tryptone is a pancreatic digest of casein. It was developed by Difco Laboratories while investigating a peptone particularly suitable for the elaboration of indole by bacteria. It is also notable for the absence of detectable levels of carbohydrates.\n\n  * Product Specs\n  * Item Bacto Tryptone\n  * CompanyBD Biosciences\n  * PriceGet quote\n  * Catalog Number 211699 / 211705 / 211701\n  * Origin Animal\n  * Size(s)2 Kg, 500 g, 10 Kg\n  * Regulatory Status LUO & MUO\n  * Quantity EA\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCasamino acids | Ingredients | MediaDive (https://mediadive.dsmz.de/ingredients/101)\nciteturn14search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; # Casamino acids ... BD-Difco (57×) BD Bacto (11×) Difco (11×) vitamin free, Difco (2×) BD (2×) 10% (2×) *, 10% (2×) with vitamins (2×) Bacto vitamin assay, Difco (1×) BD 223050 (1×) Oxoid (1×) Difco 0230-17 (1×) Difco BD (1×) BD BBL (1×)\n\n# Casamino acids\n\nIngredient ID: 101\n\n##### Structure:\n\nNot available\n\n##### Synonyms:\n\nCasamino Acid Casamino acids Difco Casaminoacids Casmino Acid Casmino acids\n\n##### Used attributes:\n\nBD-Difco (57×) BD Bacto (11×) Difco (11×) vitamin free, Difco (2×) BD (2×) 10% (2×) *, 10% (2×) with vitamins (2×) Bacto vitamin assay, Difco (1×) BD 223050 (1×) Oxoid (1×) Difco 0230-17 (1×) Difco BD (1×) BD BBL (1×)\n\n##### Found in:\n\n167 solutions 144 media\n\nDownload\n\nDownload information on this ingredient as\n\nCSV JSON\n\nDisclaimer: Most of the identifiers and chemical parameters on this page were matched automatically and were not manually curated. This overview is for your own convenience and we do not guarantee that the data shown on this page is correct.\n\n##### Chemical data:\n\nComplex substance--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBacto™ Casamino Acids 500 g | Buy Online | Gibco™ | thermofisher.cn (https://www.thermofisher.cn/order/catalog/product/cn/en/223050)\nciteturn14search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; Image: Bacto&trade; Casamino Acids ... 223050  | 500 g\n\nImage: Bacto&trade; Casamino Acids\n\nCertificates\n\nSDS\n\nGibco™\n\n# Bacto™ Casamino Acids\n\nBacto Casamino Acids is an animal origin (AO) acid hydrolysis of casein. This supplement contains low salt and iron content Read more\n\nCatalog Number  | Quantity\n--- | ---\n223050  | 500 g\n223020  | 2 kg\n223030  | 10 kg\n\n3 Options\n\nCatalog number 223050\n\nSign In to view corporate contract pricing\n\nPrice (CNY)\n\n7,432.76\n\nEach\n\nIn stock\n\nAdd to cart\n\nQuantity:\n\n500 g\n\nDelivery information\n\nStandard Products - 1-2 business days for Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou, Shenzhen and provincial capitals, 2-3 business days for 2nd-tier cities, and 4 business days for 3rd-tier cities and remote areas.\n\nBacto Casamino Acids is an animal origin (AO) acid hydrolysis of casein. This supplement contains low salt and iron content making it an excellent supplement for media formulations where nitrogen requirements are minimal. This supplement is successfully used in fermentation applications for pneumococcal, diphtheria, pertussis, tetanus, and zoster vaccines. It maintains many of the nutritional benefits of hydrolyzed casein, but is further supplemented with growth factors, cystine, maltose, and an optimum amount of iron and inorganic salts.\nCustomers have used Bacto Casamino Acids to support the growth of Bordetella, Corynebacterium, Pseudomonas, Haemophilus, and Escherichia species. Additionally, together with Bacto Yeast Extract, technical, customers have used this supplement successfully in the production of animal and human health vaccines.\n\nSpecifications\n\nProduct Line Bacto\n\nQuantity 500 g\n\nForm Powder\n\nProduct Type Casamino Acids\n\nUnit Size Each\n\nContents & Storage\n\nStorage conditions: 2°C to 25°C. Store in cool, dry conditions in well-sealed containers.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBacto大豆胨 - CAS:83-88-5 - 宝信生物官网 丨 宝信生物科技（新疆）有限公司 (https://baoxinbio.com.cn/product/72479.html?goods_id=142295)\nciteturn14search5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today;   * 品名：Bacto大豆胨 品牌：BD 货号：243620 ... ###### Bacto™ Soytone\n\n  * 品名：Bacto大豆胨 品牌：BD 货号：243620\n\n### Bacto大豆胨\n\n###### Bacto™ Soytone\n\nImage\n\n货号：243620\n\n品牌：BD\n\n英文名：Vitamin B2 (Riboflavin)\n\n别名：维生素B2;维酶素;乳黄素;核黄素;乙二素;维生素G;维生素乙2;粗制核黄素;乙种维生素二;(-)- 核黄素标准品;(-)-核黄素(维生素B2) 标准品;Riboflavin 核黄素;Riboflavin 核黄素(Vitamin B2);VB2 核黄素;核黄素 EP标准品;核黄素（E101）;核黄素(维生素B2);核黄素,BR;核黄素,对照品;核黄素峰鉴别 EP标准品;核黄酸;食品级维生素B2;水溶维生素B2;维生素;维生素 B2（Riboflavin）;维生素 B2标准品;维生素B2 (核黄素);维生\n\nCAS No：83-88-5\n\n分子式：C_{17}H_{20}N_{4}O_{6}\n\n分子量：376.37\n\n存储条件：2-25℃\n\nSKU  | 包装规格  | 单位  | 目录价 因厂家不定期调价可能造成价格未能及时更新，具体价格以下单时客服确认为准  | 您的价格 注册会员请联系客服或销售申请品牌专属折扣  | 库存  | 数量  | 购物车\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\n243620  | 500g  | 瓶  | ¥1389.00  | 请登录  | 请登录  | [Button: -] [Input] [Button: +]  | \n\n产品描述\n\nBacto 大豆胨是一种利用动物源性 (AO)（猪）酶进行消化的大豆酶解物。大豆中天然含有高浓度维生素和碳水化合物，因此对于那些不关注动物材料加工步骤的应用，Bacto 大豆胨是一种营养丰富的优质碳水化合物源。与其他大豆产品相比，该补充剂具有独特的营养特性，因此可以考虑作为一种有价值的替代品来补充哺乳动物和微生物过程。--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n조이랩 - SINCE 1992 (https://www.joylab.net/shop/item.php?it_id=0200_00019)\nciteturn14search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; #### BACTO SOYTONE(243620) ... 제조사  | BD DIFCO\n\n#### BACTO SOYTONE(243620)\n\n0200_00019\n\n상품 선택옵션 0 개, 추가옵션 0 개\n\n5.0 (0개의 사용후기) |607명 조회\n\n148,940 [Input] 구매금액(추가옵션 제외)의 1%\n\n0%\n\n제조사  | BD DIFCO\n브랜드  | BD\n배송비  | 주문시 결제\n\n  * 주문건 15시까지 결제시 당일 발송\n\n- 재고상품에 한함\n\n- 주문제작건 약 2일 소요\n\n  * 쇼핑 보안\n\n안전한 결제 옵션 · 안전한 물류 · 개인 정보 보호 · 구매 보호\n\n이미지  | 품목코드  | 품명  | 규격  | 색상  | 구매가(VAT 포함)  | 재고  |